pageType: content
background:
  type: solid
  color: "$background"
elements:
  - elementId: badge
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 40, 300, 20]
    content:
      style: "$badge"
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>ENERGY TRACK</p>
  - elementId: title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 65, 900, 40]
    content:
      style: "$pageTitle"
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p><strong>The Physical Graph: 20 European Bidding Zones</strong></p>
  - elementId: divider
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [60, 115, 1160, 0]
    shapeName: straightConnector1
    border:
      style: solid
      width: 1
      color: "$midGray"
  - elementId: figure
    elementType: image
    bounds: [60, 130, 700, 400]
    src: "D:/AI_Models/quant-alpha-foundation/paper/presentation/images/interconnector.png"
    fit:
      mode: contain
  - elementId: figure-caption
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 535, 700, 30]
    content:
      fontSize: 14
      color: "$darkGray"
      fontFamily: "QuattrocentoSans"
      lineHeight: 1.3
      align: [left, middle]
      text: |
        <p>20 zones, 38 physical borders and HVDC links. DE_LU (11 links) is the natural hub.</p>
  - elementId: right-card-1-bg
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [800, 130, 420, 120]
    shapeName: roundRect
    adjustments: [3000]
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$lightGray"
  - elementId: right-card-1-title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [820, 140, 380, 30]
    content:
      fontSize: 18
      color: "$primary"
      fontFamily: "QuattrocentoSans"
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p><strong>Physical vs Estimated</strong></p>
  - elementId: right-card-1-body
    elementType: text
    bounds: [820, 175, 380, 65]
    content:
      fontSize: 16
      color: "$text"
      fontFamily: "QuattrocentoSans"
      lineHeight: 1.4
      align: [left, top]
      text: |
        <p>Unlike the equity graph (correlation-estimated), this topology is the <strong>actual power grid</strong> — nothing is inferred from prices.</p>
  - elementId: right-card-2-bg
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [800, 270, 420, 120]
    shapeName: roundRect
    adjustments: [3000]
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$lightGray"
  - elementId: right-card-2-title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [820, 280, 380, 30]
    content:
      fontSize: 18
      color: "$accent"
      fontFamily: "QuattrocentoSans"
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p><strong>Alpha Framing: Failed Honestly</strong></p>
  - elementId: right-card-2-body
    elementType: text
    bounds: [820, 315, 380, 65]
    content:
      fontSize: 16
      color: "$text"
      fontFamily: "QuattrocentoSans"
      lineHeight: 1.4
      align: [left, top]
      text: |
        <p>Three nested artifacts (overlap, annualisation, clip) produced Sharpe 8–11. Controls caught them. Under honest returns: <strong>loses money</strong>.</p>
  - elementId: right-card-3-bg
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [800, 410, 420, 120]
    shapeName: roundRect
    adjustments: [3000]
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$lightGray"
  - elementId: right-card-3-title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [820, 420, 380, 30]
    content:
      fontSize: 18
      color: "$secondary"
      fontFamily: "QuattrocentoSans"
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p><strong>Forecasting Reframe: Succeeded</strong></p>
  - elementId: right-card-3-body
    elementType: text
    bounds: [820, 455, 380, 65]
    content:
      fontSize: 16
      color: "$text"
      fontFamily: "QuattrocentoSans"
      lineHeight: 1.4
      align: [left, top]
      text: |
        <p>Reframed from "is there alpha?" to "does the graph improve forecasts?" — clean, control-validated positives.</p>
  - elementId: insight-bar
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [60, 580, 1160, 50]
    shapeName: roundRect
    adjustments: [3000]
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$primary"
  - elementId: insight-text
    elementType: text
    bounds: [80, 585, 1120, 40]
    content:
      fontSize: 16
      color: "#FFFFFF"
      fontFamily: "QuattrocentoSans"
      lineHeight: 1.4
      align: [left, middle]
      text: |
        <p>The energy track's most transferable lesson: <strong>treat implausible magnitudes as alarms</strong>, not discoveries. Sharpe 8 is a symptom, not a result.</p>
  - elementId: footer-bar
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [0, 680, 1280, 40]
    shapeName: rect
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$primary"
  - elementId: footer-left
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 685, 600, 30]
    content:
      fontSize: 12
      color: "#FFFFFF"
      fontFamily: "QuattrocentoSans"
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>Relational Alpha Factors · GAT Capstone</p>
  - elementId: footer-right
    elementType: text
    bounds: [1100, 685, 120, 30]
    content:
      fontSize: 12
      color: "#FFFFFF"
      fontFamily: "QuattrocentoSans"
      align: [right, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>9</p>
